  "slug": "jetty",
  "name": "Jetty",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build, run, and monitor AI/ML workflows on Jetty — from prompt to production in 5 minutes.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `create-runbook` (Create a new runbook with guided assistance), `jetty` (Manage Jetty workflows and assets), `jetty-setup` (Set up Jetty for the first time), `optimize-runbook` (Analyze previous Jetty workflow runs and propose targeted improvements to your runbook)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `jetty`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install jetty@claude-community` from `jettyio/jettyio-skills`.",
